{"3860370":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Handymen Together","steam_appid":3860370,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5070100],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDYMEN IN ACTION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crew, your tools, and homes filled with chaos. This cooperative simulator for 1-4 players lets you take on the role of a team of jack-of-all-trades. Together, you repair, paint, move, clean, and rescue clients from trouble - and sometimes create even more chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/c7a5fb643413e4ea5cdb8a0f0c1be538.poster.avif?t=1790676449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/c7a5fb643413e4ea5cdb8a0f0c1be538.webm?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/c7a5fb643413e4ea5cdb8a0f0c1be538.mp4?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some jobs can be tackled solo, but the real fun begins when you work together. Pass tools, move heavy furniture as a team, manage tasks simultaneously, and rescue each other when something goes wrong. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication, coordination, and… a sense of humor are key in this job.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/081f1ee6b3fc637a225ddf10cfc82530.poster.avif?t=1790676449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/081f1ee6b3fc637a225ddf10cfc82530.webm?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/081f1ee6b3fc637a225ddf10cfc82530.mp4?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOBS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every home is a new challenge:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >painting walls, replacing floorboards, repairing plumbing, taking out trash, rearranging furniture, cleaning up after disasters, and saving rooms that have seen too much. Over time, you'll encounter more unusual jobs - from magic letters to hidden rooms and mysterious clients.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/8fcabad40c68303f6b749ae84a352231.poster.avif?t=1790676449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/8fcabad40c68303f6b749ae84a352231.webm?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/8fcabad40c68303f6b749ae84a352231.mp4?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS AND CHAOS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving a bathtub with two people? Sure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrying a refrigerator up the stairs? Good luck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is based on physics, so every step can end in laughter, disaster, or both.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where even the simplest task can turn into a nightmare.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/68b9e32670e62ff44bd6670416e21b51.poster.avif?t=1790676449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/68b9e32670e62ff44bd6670416e21b51.webm?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/68b9e32670e62ff44bd6670416e21b51.mp4?t=1790676449\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online co-op for 1-4 players<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physically move objects and tools<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Various jobs: repairs, renovations, cleaning, and renovations<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Houses full of interactive elements and surprises<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized locations, apartments, houses, and more unusual places<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character customization<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Humor stemming from physics and cooperation<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Jobs from &quot;normal&quot; and... not-so-normal clients<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDYMEN IN ACTION<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crew, your tools, and homes filled with chaos. This cooperative simulator for 1-4 players lets you take on the role of a team of jack-of-all-trades. Together, you repair, paint, move, clean, and rescue clients from trouble - and sometimes create even more chaos.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/c7a5fb643413e4ea5cdb8a0f0c1be538.poster.avif?t=1790676449\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3860370\/extras\/c7a5fb643413e4ea5cdb8a0f0c1be538.web